{"candidateAnswer":"Near the water","evidence":"[D16:16 | 9:13 pm on 9 November, 2023] Evan: Thanks, Sam. Your kind words and support mean a lot. It's great to have you here. I'm gonna stay positive and keep going. Cheers!\n[D16:18 | 9:13 pm on 9 November, 2023] Evan: Yeah, it's this peaceful place close to my home. I often go there to relax and unwind.\n[D16:20 | 9:13 pm on 9 November, 2023] Evan: Oh, I wish I could bring you along. That picture was actually taken last Friday at my favorite spot by the beach. Watching the waves and the sunset colors really helps me find peace, especially during tough times. It's a beautiful reminder of nature's resilience. We should definitely plan to go together someday.","itemId":"urn:uuid:c0d6120f-4b55-56aa-ad33-363077f024d9","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:021d8615adf219e18a2d6817e1862ec7be4e95cb946d3b1a26cb61b733ae274a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Does Evan live close to a beach or mountains?","referenceAnswer":"beach","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"021d8615adf219e18a2d6817e1862ec7be4e95cb946d3b1a26cb61b733ae274a"}}]}